# 所有文本文件在版本库里一律用 LF。
# Windows 检出时由 git 按需转换，避免 CRLF 混进 diff 与 shell 脚本。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做行尾与编码转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary

# 生成物与锁文件在 diff 与语言统计里折叠，避免淹没真实改动
*.sum linguist-generated
package-lock.json linguist-generated
dist/** linguist-generated
